<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina sells 17,000 T wheat to Brazil - traders.</title>
<headline>Argentina sells 17,000 T wheat to Brazil - traders.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>An exporter Friday sold Brazilian buyers 17,000 tonnes of wheat at $185 a tonne, not including freight, traders said.</p>
<p>The wheat was sold for May shipment from the port of Necochea, they said.</p>
<p>((Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
